      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "name": "Egg & Turkey Stuffed Peppers",
          "category_label": "Lunch",
          "serving_unit_label": "serving",
          "instructions": [
            "Heat oven to 200 °C.",
            "Beat the eggs, egg whites and milk, then set aside.",
            "Heat the coconut oil in a pan over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 3 minutes until softened and browned.",
            "Add in the turkey, oregano and cumin, season with salt and pepper. Cook until meat is cooked through, about 5 minutes. Then add the spinach, and mix until it wilts about 2 minutes.",
            "Increase the heat and add in the eggs. Pull the eggs across the skillet with a spatula. Repeat for about 3 minutes until eggs are cooked. Then set aside.",
            "Cut the peppers horizontally and remove the seeds, then stuff with the scrambled eggs and turkey.",
            "Place the peppers in a baking dish and sprinkle them with grated cheese.",
            "Bake in the oven for 15 minutes, until cheese has melted and the edges have browned.",
            "To serve, sprinkle with chopped parsley."
          ],
          "notes": null
        },
        "sk": {
          "name": "Papriky plnené vajcom a morčacím mäsom",
          "category_label": "Obed",
          "serving_unit_label": "porcia",
          "instructions": [
            "Rúru predhrejte na 200 °C.",
            "Vyšľahajte vajcia, vaječné bielky a mlieko, a dajte bokom.",
            "Na panvici zohrejte kokosový olej na strednom ohni. Pridajte cibuľu a restujte 3 minúty, kým nezmäkne a nezozlatne.",
            "Pridajte morčacie mäso, oregáno a rímsku rascu, dochuťte soľou a korením. Opekajte asi 5 minút, kým nie je mäso prepečené. Potom pridajte špenát a miešajte asi 2 minúty, kým nezavädne.",
            "Zvýšte teplotu a pridajte vajíčka. Obracačkou miešajte vajíčka po panvici. Opakujte asi 3 minúty, kým nie sú vajcia upečené. Potom dajte zmes bokom.",
            "Papriky vodorovne rozkrojte, odstráňte semienka a naplňte ich praženicou s morčacím mäsom.",
            "Papriky vložte do zapekacej misy a posypte nastrúhaným syrom.",
            "Pečte v rúre 15 minút, kým sa syr neroztopí a okraje nezhnednú.",
            "Podávajte posypané nasekanou petržlenovou vňaťou."
          ],
          "notes": null
        }
      },
